DESCRIPTION >
    - `cncf_country_top_projects.pipe` serves the top projects list of the CNCF country report: CNCF projects ranked by the country's contributors.
    - Parameters:
    - `countryCode`: Required ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 country code (e.g., 'FR') - inherited from `cncf_country_activities`
    - `startDate`: Optional DateTime filter for activities after timestamp (e.g., '2024-01-01 00:00:00')
    - `endDate`: Optional DateTime filter for activities before timestamp (e.g., '2024-12-31 23:59:59')
    - `includeCodeContributions`, `includeCollaborations`, `includeOtherContributions`: Optional booleans (defaults: code contributions only)
    - `limit`: Optional integer for the number of projects returned, defaults to 10
    - Response: `name`, `slug`, `logoUrl`, `contributorCount`, `contributionCount`

TOKEN "insights-app-token" READ

TAGS "Report"

NODE cncf_country_top_projects_projects
SQL >
    SELECT segmentId, name, slug, logoUrl
    FROM insightsProjects FINAL
    WHERE segmentId != '' AND enabled = 1 AND deletedAt IS NULL

NODE cncf_country_top_projects_result
SQL >
    %
    SELECT
        p.name AS name,
        p.slug AS slug,
        p.logoUrl AS logoUrl,
        uniq(a.memberId) AS contributorCount,
        count() AS contributionCount
    FROM cncf_country_activities a
    INNER JOIN cncf_country_top_projects_projects p ON p.segmentId = a.segmentId
    GROUP BY name, slug, logoUrl
    ORDER BY contributorCount DESC, contributionCount DESC
    LIMIT {{ Int32(limit, 10, description="Number of projects returned", required=False) }}
